  "question": {
    "text": "Let $A=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc}5 & 5 \\alpha & \\alpha \\\\ 0 & \\alpha & 5 \\alpha \\\\ 0 & 0 & 5\\end{array}\\right]$. If $\\left|A^2\\right|=25$, then $|\\alpha|$ equals"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "\n$5^2$\n",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "\n$1$\n",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "\n$1 / 5$\n",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "\n$5$",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\mathrm{A}^2=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc}5 & 5 \\alpha & \\alpha \\\\ 0 & \\alpha & 5 \\alpha \\\\ 0 & 0 & 5\\end{array}\\right]\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc}5 & 5 \\alpha & \\alpha \\\\ 0 & \\alpha & 5 \\alpha \\\\ 0 & 0 & 5\\end{array}\\right]$\n$\\mathrm{A}^2=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc}25 & 25 \\alpha+5 \\alpha^2 & 5 \\alpha+25 \\alpha^2+5 \\alpha \\\\ 0 & \\alpha^2 & 5 \\alpha^2+25 \\alpha \\\\ 0 & 0 & 25\\end{array}\\right]$\n$625 \\alpha^2=25$\n$\\Rightarrow|\\alpha|=\\frac{1}{5}$."
  }
